        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Deceptively spacious 4 bedroom Family Home in immaculate condition, occupying a quite corner location within walking distance of all amenities.\r\n\r\nThis is a particularly fine property where no expense has been spared and is sure to be of interest to owner occupiers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe spacious accommodation, over two floors, extends to approximately 193m2 (2,075sq.ft.) and is laid out as follows:\r\n\r\nHallway, Sitting Room, Living Room, Extensive Kitchen, Utility/Laundry, Guest Bathroom on the ground floor with four bedrooms and two bathrooms on the fist floor.\r\n\r\nOutside: Side entrance to a two roomed building currently used as a Beauty Salon but suited to many uses e.g. Home Office etc, Patio area and fully fitted bar.\r\n\r\nGas Central Heating\r\nTurnkey Condition\r\nPVC Double Glazing\r\nVeneer wood flooring throughout\r\nBER'D'\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
